<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42620" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑρμην-εύω</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑρμᾱνεύω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>SIG</u>
			1168.88
		</span></i> (Epid.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>interpret</i>
			foreign tongues, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.4.4
			</span></i>; <i>translate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Th.</u>
				49
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ Π̔ωμαϊκῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PRyl.</u>
					62.30
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλληνιστί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					2.12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jb.</u>
				42.17
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>explain, expound,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				398
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				636.5
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑμῖν ταῦτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					3.2.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅ τι λέγει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philyll.
					11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τῶν ποιητῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ion</u>
					535a
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Epin.</u>
				985b
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>SE</u>
				166b11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>put into words, express,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				966b
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι διά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermog.
					<u>Id.</u>
					2.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι πεζῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Meth.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>describe, write about,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Νεῖλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Demetr.
					<u>Eloc.</u>
					121
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> abs.,
				<i>speak clearly, articulate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				5.74
			</span></i>.</div>
